CORE
zero_length_null.c
--pointer-check --bounds-check
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A zero-length __builtin_memcpy/__builtin_memmove with a null source and/or
destination is accepted (C2y N3322). Before __builtin_memcpy and
__builtin_memmove had models: "no body for callee __builtin_memcpy: FAILURE".
